<p>The target enemy will be partially removed from the normal flow of time for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns, inhibiting their ability to interact with the world. All damage taken will be reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">78%, 72%, 68%, 65%, 63%,</acronym> while all damage dealt will be reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">42%, 48%, 52%, 55%, 57%.</acronym></p><p>While active, you form the frayed threads of their timeline into a temporal clone of them for the same duration, which assists you in combat. This clone is identical, but has <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 28%, 32%, 35%, 37%</acronym> reduced life and deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">42%, 48%, 52%, 55%, 57%</acronym> damage.</p>